%% request: CI/CD from GitHub to Cloud Run with staging approval
flowchart LR
    classDef gh fill:#f6f8fa,stroke:#24292e
    classDef ci fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0
    classDef stg fill:#fff8e1,stroke:#f9a825
    classDef prod fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:3px
    classDef bad fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828

    Dev([Developer]) -->|git push / PR| GH[(GitHub Repo)]:::gh
    GH -->|webhook| GA

    subgraph CI["GitHub Actions: CI"]
        GA[Trigger workflow]:::ci --> LINT[Lint + unit tests]:::ci
        LINT --> T{Tests pass?}
        T -- No --> FAIL[Fail PR check]:::bad
        T -- Yes --> BUILD[Build Docker image]:::ci
        BUILD --> SCAN[Vulnerability scan]:::ci
        SCAN --> PUSH[Push to Artifact Registry]:::ci
    end

    PUSH --> AUTH[Auth via Workload Identity Federation]

    subgraph Staging["Staging"]
        DS[Deploy to Cloud Run<br/>service: app-staging]:::stg
        SMOKE[Smoke / e2e tests]:::stg
        DS --> SMOKE
    end

    AUTH --> DS
    SMOKE --> OK{Passed?}
    OK -- No --> ROLL[Rollback + notify Slack]:::bad
    OK -- Yes --> APPR{{Manual approval<br/>GitHub Environment reviewers}}

    subgraph Production["Production"]
        DP[Deploy new revision<br/>no traffic]:::prod
        CAN[Canary 10% traffic]:::prod
        FULL[100% traffic]:::prod
        DP --> CAN --> FULL
    end

    APPR -- Approved --> DP
    APPR -- Rejected --> STOP((Stop)):::bad
    CAN -. error rate high .-> ROLL
    FULL ==> DONE([Release complete]):::prod
